	(text "PHOTODIODE FRONT-END  |  closes the PDH loop on-board readback\n2x Thorlabs FGA01FC InGaAs PD (R=1.0 A/W @1550nm, Cj~2pF@5V, Vr_max=20V, 300ps, TO-46(mod) FC/PC bulkhead).\nReverse bias: cathode -> VPD (+12V from U_PDREG LT3042); anode -> PDx_IN = TIA virtual ground (VREF_MID~2.5V).\n  => steady reverse bias ~9.5V (well under 20V max) -> low Cj for the decompensated OPA858 TIA.\nCathode AC-bypassed to GND (C_Kx) so the MHz photocurrent returns locally and flows into the TIA summing node.\nVPD = 100uA * R_SET ; R_SET=120k(0.1%) -> 12.0V.  R_ILIM, C_SET per LT3042 datasheet.\nFLAG: FGA01FC has NO stock KiCad footprint -> assign custom TO-46(mod) 3-lead (A/K/case) land + FC bulkhead mount.\nFLAG (cascade): adding the on-board PD changes the TIA input capacitance budget -> re-check OPA858 Rf/Cf (Cf<=Cin/6)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
